    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) A verb is an action word. It tells what someone or something does.\nRun, jump, eat, sleep and read are verbs.\nIn the poem Out in the Garden, bounce, throw and catch are verbs.\nIn the story Badal and Moti, Moti barked and followed. Barked and followed are verbs.\nAct out a verb and let friends guess it."
    }
